<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Easy Choice Sports</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f1f4f2;
      color: #202820;
    }

    header {
      background: #087443;
      color: white;
      padding: 25px 12px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 30px;
    }

    nav {
      background: #064b2c;
      padding: 15px 5px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 12px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .welcome {
      background: white;
      padding: 25px 15px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: 25px auto;
      padding: 0 15px;
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 7px #00000012;
    }

    .card h2 {
      color: #087443;
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .match {
      padding: 13px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
    }

    .match:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #e0f4e8;
      color: #075d34;
      padding: 5px 9px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    footer {
      background: #064b2c;
      color: white;
      padding: 22px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    @media (max-width: 500px) {
      nav a {
        display: inline-block;
        margin: 7px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <h1>⚽ Easy Choice Sports</h1>
    <p>Your home for football updates</p>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#fixtures">Fixtures</a>
    <a href="#results">Results</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
  </nav>

  <section class="welcome" id="home">
    <h2>Welcome to Easy Choice Sports</h2>
    <p>Stay connected to the beautiful game.</p>
    <span class="tag">Football • Teams • Results</span>
  </section>

  <main>
    <section class="card" id="fixtures">
      <h2>📅 Upcoming Fixtures</h2>
      <p>Football match schedules will appear here.</p>
      <div class="match">
        <strong>Home Team vs Away Team</strong>
        <p>Match date and time to be announced.</p>
      </div>
      <p><small>These are sample placeholders, not confirmed fixtures.</small></p>
    </section>

    <section class="card" id="results">
      <h2>🏆 Match Results</h2>
      <p>Check here for match results and scores.</p>
      <div class="match">
        <strong>Results coming soon</strong>
        <p>Scores will be added when verified.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>🌍 Football News</h2>
      <p>Follow your favourite teams and competitions.
      Visit again for more sports updates.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="card" id="about">
      <h2>About Easy Choice Sports</h2>
      <p>Easy Choice Sports is a football information website
      for fixtures, results, teams, and sports news.</p>
      <p>Built in Kenya 🇰🇪</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>Easy Choice Sports © 2026</p>
    <p>Football information for fans everywhere.
</p><section id="football-fixtures" class="card">
  <h2>📅 Upcoming Football Fixtures</h2>
  <p>Check official schedules for the latest match dates.</p>

  <p>
    <a href="https://www.premierleague.com/en/matches">
      Premier League Fixtures
    </a>
  </p>

  <p>
    <a href="https://footballkenya.org/">
      Kenyan Football News — FKF
    </a>
  </p>

  <hr>

  <h2 id="results">🏆 Match Results</h2>
  <p>Check the official sources above for confirmed scores.</p>
</section>
